ing Description: The CNPJ tax ID of the sender (seller) Example: \\\"12345678000123\\\" Field Path: dataSource[].extendInfo.sender_cnpj 6. sender_ie - Sender IE Number Type: String Description: The state registration number (Inscrição Estadual) of the sender Example: \\\"123456789012\\\" Field Path: dataSource[].extendInfo.sender_ie 7. recipient_cpf - Recipient Tax ID (CPF) Type: String Description: The CPF tax ID of the recipient (buyer) Example: \\\"12345678901\\\" Field Path: dataSource[].extendInfo.recipient_cpf 8. printInvoiceDate - Invoice Issue Date Type: Long (Timestamp) Description: The print/issue date of the invoice, Unix timestamp in milliseconds Example: 1634567890000 (Corresponds to: 2021-10-18) Field Path: dataSource[].printInvoiceDate\"}]"
